--[[
  XM9 GUI (Roblox LocalScript)

  SETUP:
  1. Open your game in Roblox Studio.
  2. Insert a LocalScript into StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts.
  3. Paste this whole script in and press Play.

  CONTROLS:
  - Drag the title bar to move the window.
  - "-" minimizes, "X" hides. RightShift shows/hides the window.
  - Tabs: Visuals (ESP) | Combat (Aimbot) | Movement | Fling | Players (Teleport)
  - Aimbot: turn it on, then hold Right Mouse Button.
  - Fly (Movement tab, or press F): WASD to move, Space up, Left Ctrl down.
  - Fling (Fling tab): pick targets, START FLING launches them, STOP FLING stops.
]]

